{"uid":"8a6fdd5a6616a68c","name":"test_derive_break_glass_gate_evidence_catches_a_digest_that_has_gone_stale","fullName":"tests.test_workspace_release_governance#test_derive_break_glass_gate_evidence_catches_a_digest_that_has_gone_stale","historyId":"996c63801a1cb4208a844de72027d597","time":{"start":1792616390654,"stop":1792616390694,"duration":40},"description":"Simulates evidence going stale between an earlier read and the apply\n    itself: a caller holds a ``gate_evidence_sha256`` it captured earlier,\n    but the release's own persisted evidence digest has since moved on (a\n    fresh evaluation superseded it). Re-deriving from the release row right\n    now -- not trusting the caller's earlier-captured digest -- must catch\n    this live, and feeding the truthful ``False`` into\n    ``create_workspace_break_glass_apply`` (unchanged) must still deny.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Simulates evidence going stale between an earlier read and the apply<br />\nitself: a caller holds a <code>gate_evidence_sha256</code> it captured earlier,<br />\nbut the release's own persisted evidence digest has since moved on (a<br />\nfresh evaluation superseded it). Re-deriving from the release row right<br />\nnow -- not trusting the caller's earlier-captured digest -- must catch<br />\nthis live, and feeding the truthful <code>False</code> into<br />\n<code>create_workspace_break_glass_apply</code> (unchanged) must still deny.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1792614452107,"stop":1792614452107,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1792614456026,"stop":1792614456026,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parame